THE MUSIC

"Roderick Tron", by Jimmi, from the album JIMMI (2026). A magmacrunch media
record label release rather than an outside licence, and reserved the same way
as everything in the section above.

The track is not stored in this repository. The browser build loads it from the
website's own copy at music/jukebox/songs/, so there is one file rather than
two that can drift apart.

The sound EFFECTS are not recordings at all. They are generated from oscillators
at runtime in web/js/sfx.js, so there is nothing to license, nothing to
download, and the note pickups can be pitched -- collecting a trail of notes
walks up a pentatonic scale, which is the closest this game gets to being about
what it is about.


